%%label II. Larghetto
%%note D minor. A sarabande-like air for the strings; a solo oboe takes the tune in the second half and the violins join it for the return.
X:1
T:Handel’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Larghetto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of G. F. Handel
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Larghetto" 1/4=58
%%score ob1 [v1 v2 va vc cb] hpd
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:ob1 clef=treble name="Ob. solo"
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
V:hpd clef=treble name="Hpd."
K:Dm
V:ob1
%%MIDI program 68
V:v1
%%MIDI program 48
V:v2
%%MIDI program 48
V:va
%%MIDI program 48
V:vc
%%MIDI program 48
V:cb
%%MIDI program 43
V:hpd
%%MIDI program 6
